  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お、恋鐘\r\n俺は大丈夫だよ。でも……今日は何かあるのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004020020,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "んふふ～、今日はね～……プロデューサーのために\r\nスペシャルなお弁当用意してきたんよ！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400402/2004004020020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え、弁当……？\r\nもしかして作ってきてくれたのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004020030,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "うん！　この前、おにぎりくれたお礼たい\r\n気にせんとたっくさん食べて～！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400402/2004004020030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、恋鐘こそ気にしなくてもよかったのに\r\nでも……嬉しいよ。遠慮なくいただこうかな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004020040,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "んふふー、期待は裏切らんよ～\r\nプロデューサーはエビで鯛を釣ったようなもんたい",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400402/2004004020040"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004020050,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "じゃあ、これ……！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400402/2004004020050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ、持つよ\r\n──へぇ、結構なボリュームじゃないか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004020060,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ふぁっ……！\r\nプ、プロデューサー、待たんね……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400402/2004004020060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……え？\r\nあ、すまん！　手が当たっちゃったな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004020070,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "わ、わわ……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
