  },
  {
    "id": 2004004020150,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "え！　だ、だめだめっ！\r\n絶対、中身ぐちゃぐちゃやし……",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400402/2004004020150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004020160,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "うち、\r\nプロデューサーにはちゃんとしたの食べてもらいたいんよ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_doya",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400402/2004004020160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "恋鐘……？\r\nそうか……ありがとうな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004020170,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "うん……\r\nばってんせっかく待ってもらったのに悪かね……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400402/2004004020170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004020180,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "あ！　じゃあ、今日はうちの分のお弁当食べて！\r\nそっちは大丈夫やけん",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400402/2004004020180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、それだと恋鐘の分がなくなっちゃうだろ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "恋鐘はちゃんと、自分の分を食べてくれ\r\nせっかく作ってくれたんだし、やっぱりいただくよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004020190,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ホント？　プロデューサー……\r\n……ありがとう",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400402/2004004020190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004020200,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "つ、次はもーっとすごいお弁当作って、\r\n100倍にしてお礼するけん！",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400402/2004004020200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004020210,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "楽しみにしとってね～！　プロデューサー！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400402/2004004020210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004020220,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "えっと……肉じゃががメインで、\r\n後は卵焼きとか……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400402/2004004020220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お、肉じゃがなら混ざっても大丈夫じゃないか？\r\n俺はすき焼き丼とか、大好きだぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "恋鐘がよければ……\r\nそれ、食べてもいいか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004020230,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "え！　じゃ、じゃあ、せめて丼に移し替えてくる！\r\n待っとってプロデューサー！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400402/2004004020230"
  },
