  {
    "id": 2004004020240,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "こ、こんな感じになったばってん……\r\nどうかいな……？",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400402/2004004020240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おお！　丼に盛ったら完全にすき焼き丼だな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……ありがとう\r\nいただいていいのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004020250,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "も、もっちろんたい！\r\n……でもどうかいな、変な味になってなか？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400402/2004004020250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、美味いよ\r\nはは、おかわりが欲しいくらいだぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004020260,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "はぁ……よかった～……\r\nばってん、これがうちのベストじゃないけん！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400402/2004004020260"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004020270,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "次こそは完璧にお礼してみせるばい！\r\n期待しとってね！　プロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "smile4",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400402/2004004020270"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004020280,
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "な、なんね～……突然\r\nお礼するんはうちの方やったろ？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400402/2004004020280"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004020290,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ばってん……うち、お弁当ダメにして……\r\nごめん……プロデューサー",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400402/2004004020290"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、作ってきてくれて嬉しいよ\r\nそれに朝とか早かったんじゃないか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004020300,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "そんなこと……全然大したことなかよ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400402/2004004020300"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、大したことだぞ、恋鐘\r\nその弁当……よかったら、食べさせてくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004020310,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "え！？　だ、ダメダメ！\r\nプロデューサーにはちゃんとしたのを食べて欲しか……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400402/2004004020310"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも、味は完璧なんだろ？\r\n綺麗に詰められてるとこを想像しながら食べるよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004020320,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "う、うん……じゃあ……\r\n食べてみてくれる……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400402/2004004020320"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ。……はは、思ったより崩れてないんじゃないか\r\n俺には、美味そうに見えるな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004020330,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "プ、プロデューサー……！\r\nえへへ……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400402/2004004020330"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004020340,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ありがと～！　ばり嬉しかばい！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400402/2004004020340"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004020350,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ばってん、今度こそはうちのお弁当の\r\n本当の姿を見せちゃるけんね～！　楽しみにしとってね！",
    "charAnim2": "face_doya",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
